# ==========================================
# VoiceFlow Environment Configuration
# ==========================================

# Optional: Firebase Authentication
# If these environment variables are left blank or omitted,
# VoiceFlow automatically activates its built-in Local Secure Authentication Engine
# (using client-side Web Crypto SHA-256 salted hashing and session isolation).
#
# To enable real Firebase Authentication:
# 1. Create a Firebase project in the Firebase Console (https://console.firebase.google.com).
# 2. Enable "Email/Password" sign-in under Authentication > Sign-in method.
# 3. Add a Web App in Project Settings and copy your Firebase SDK config values below:

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
